#: search:search_D216F5A2_90FB_432B_8641_E77B5EBFC230
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7f8bc58e5f644b04d8ce25fe1106d03a11ae30909bf5e2d4ce3ab414732fbb93
#. default-sha256: 5f75eb5ef43639b6a5b0bae5b20043bcd738845a454fdf4e2824fa139007ddbd
msgctxt "search:search_D216F5A2_90FB_432B_8641_E77B5EBFC230"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Oh, there you are, Master. ⟪k:5⟫You gave me quite the scare.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"After returning from the third door, you disappeared without a word."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫啊，⟪k:5⟫您在这里啊？⟪k:6⟫下仆可着急了。⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫回过神来时，⟪k:9⟫就看不"
"到您了。"

#: search:search_76472D0C_19F0_45BD_95FE_38AFC767ED36
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1c4ffafc28d89e4638aa7edcc14df6021c062fd23d72bec496bac10509dc9b9a
#. default-sha256: bbdd3c765df7bbf830ecab61390967770d23377c0a119d2b993d5e1acd6ffe3c
msgctxt "search:search_76472D0C_19F0_45BD_95FE_38AFC767ED36"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫It was you who disappeared..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫……你消失了……"

#: search:search_3F44A27A_5E4B_498F_81C9_43A353E7CFEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 81daded83cadfa676a4b027f8458d3265d44c8fb78766c62b646e48540e1e117
#. default-sha256: f06cfadcdee9cc022efb46a280a39a3eea2c1e01f65e85fa1535d4365d58c816
msgctxt "search:search_3F44A27A_5E4B_498F_81C9_43A353E7CFEB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Oh my... ⟪k:3⟫It was ⟪k:4⟫I⟪k:5⟫ who disappeared?⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫That is quite strange. "
"I did not go anywhere, as far as I am aware."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫哎呀……⟪k:3⟫您说不见的是下仆吗？⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫奇怪了，⟪k:6⟫应该没有那种事啊。"

#: search:search_E2712B82_695C_4D54_A63F_254D4F55FE9C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e12c55fea0679cf38f6a0493b0de99d99f31d843b5268aa4541dc7d2745b4ae
#. default-sha256: 09df3e187006348796efb9f7d48287ee27a79966033fadf0437dc35ea4eecac4
msgctxt "search:search_E2712B82_695C_4D54_A63F_254D4F55FE9C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Nevertheless, I am glad to have found you.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I would have been at a complete "
"loss for what to do⟪k:4⟫if I had been separated from you yet again."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫不过，⟪k:2⟫看到您，⟪k:3⟫下仆就安心了。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫如果您再次离开了的话，⟪k:6⟫下仆该怎么办"
"呢……"

#: search:search_984DB043_1880_4220_B63F_8C140C1860F6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8c924768bec1a78e630d724d134448572ff79916e1a0e200c33039fae250d0c5
