#: search:search_D3552295_8ED2_49C6_BCAB_F2721B0457FF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 720eafd7d3122ed13f04b94e447729319c75e69026a27994979dfff63456c5b9
#. default-sha256: 267ca5e7b16b3cf85496fe649c18b90a1753922cd4a297f6163407cd64552fbf
msgctxt "search:search_D3552295_8ED2_49C6_BCAB_F2721B0457FF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(Am I in mine, though...?)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（……我是清醒吗……）"

#: search:search_E72785FD_5854_43DD_B8DA_45D0F2A1512F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 15d851a6eb21fa79401087c3155839b1f227c67cf0bad37b804917e241746a35
#. default-sha256: ac6bdba7b8b7a0d9bd6779fcc45de6345d7d2f5cdb2e9480f1a21752e40e1c0c
msgctxt "search:search_E72785FD_5854_43DD_B8DA_45D0F2A1512F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hehehe... ⟪k:3⟫I am very much not a ghost.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Would I be able to hold your "
"hand if I were?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫呵呵……⟪k:3⟫不是那样的哦。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫如果是幽灵的话，⟪k:6⟫就不能握住您的手了吧？"

#: search:search_7860D620_E190_48D4_80A9_0805BEAEAB0E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 84e0470c44d79bd130f712205258cd54e2ca9fca6d06ef4c046981910123a418
#. default-sha256: 7dc92e85bd7c4b3fe9bc9c6e09ea26d138ce9a3135376ec3a1ff40053af7e467
msgctxt "search:search_7860D620_E190_48D4_80A9_0805BEAEAB0E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Saying this, the Maid took ⟪k:1⟫Your⟪k:2⟫the Departed’s⟪k:3⟫ hand.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫It was cold "
"enough to send a shudder down ⟪k:6⟫Your⟪k:7⟫his⟪k:8⟫ spine—⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫and completely devoid "
"of life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫女仆说着，⟪k:1⟫再次握起了「⟪k:2⟫你⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫死者⟪k:5⟫」的手。⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫她的手还是冷得令人吃"
"惊，⟪k:8⟫感觉不到生气。"

#: search:search_878F0081_8437_4841_BF7E_8563EAA5D849
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9ab4eeb277722c076e5e487c99a32814ba8da07d5d13f46ee731ad4dea53353a
#. default-sha256: b44ebd27067dada5c6a01261885021efd9fa21f911738cb8c866058f1f3a4c90
msgctxt "search:search_878F0081_8437_4841_BF7E_8563EAA5D849"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though, as chilling as it may have been,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You⟪k:3⟫he⟪k:4⟫ still took comfort in the "
"feeling of her hand in ⟪k:5⟫Yours⟪k:6⟫his⟪k:7⟫."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……然而。⟪k:1⟫即使是这么冰冷的手，⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫握着也会感到安心。"

#: search:search_48AD1506_DC35_4A5B_A899_B0176737D537
