msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫…………"

#: search:search_A345CB21_107B_42AB_A6B9_316312D1F2B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8196a961a7f5c736be680d599e6b33569066ee54003b5f5bc5da8b340bb05d70
