msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫(It does the opposite for me...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫（……我不一样……）"

#: search:search_3784042F_9D7B_4CE0_9C70_8140BD6B0EE6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5322065e9d38d370b1ddf4f192f2e0ca36abaf8581a9fd7dcc4ed0a2f06151ba
#. default-sha256: 1375afe2a65b2b3697e8d55cc7a2e394cc369ad8c527ca6078f0222ee778bc7e
msgctxt "search:search_3784042F_9D7B_4CE0_9C70_8140BD6B0EE6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A dreadful, deep-rooted curse afflicts this mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫这座洋馆被诅咒了。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫那是个非常、⟪k:5⟫非常、⟪k:6⟫顽固、⟪k:7⟫可怕的诅咒……"

#: search:search_09EC7CC8_EB4C_4E07_AA96_11D3283A7612
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8213e308282469fcae0b16b747d4addf68df8ededb4f23e5665dab099fd80f6c
#. default-sha256: c5ec862db21e06ab9938cee802e25c2636429e49b797f8143392c50d8661bacc
msgctxt "search:search_09EC7CC8_EB4C_4E07_AA96_11D3283A7612"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫However, this room is the one exception.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Can you feel the purity that hangs in "
"the air, Master?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫但是，⟪k:2⟫只有这个房间是不一样的。⟪k:3⟫老爷，⟪k:4⟫您没感觉到吗？⟪k:5⟫这里飘荡着的清净的"
"空气。"

